OL,3,GNEWSAFarewell to cross-Channel ferry
OL,4,Aafter three decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FListen live on BBC Radio Solent for
OL,7,FDorset as Brittany Ferries' Barfleur
OL,8,Fsails out of Poole for the final time
OL,10,FThe operator has blamed high costs and
OL,11,Ffalling passenger numbers for the
OL,12,Fdecision to end the 30-year route to
OL,13,FCherbourg and sell the vessel
OL,15,FPeople are expected to gather on the
OL,16,Fshoreline and on small boats to say
OL,17,Ffarewell
OL,19,FThe ferry is scheduled to cast off its
OL,20,Fmoorings at Poole's ferry terminal at
OL,21,F08:30 BST
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
